I am have been playing this game for a long time (846 hours as of this review). This was a great alpha game and for $20 was absolutely worth the price. Now that they have increased the price to $60 and still have a lot of the same problems as it did in alpha, makes this not worth buying at all. Do not buy until they (if they ever do) fix the game to be on par for the price tag they want.
To sum up;
DO NOT BUY THIS GAME AT FULL PRICE YET. Keep your eye on it for either a sale, or until they change something to be worth a steep price tag.

