Warframe is a very great mmo game i would say its the best in his kind. But no game are perfect just like this one,
There are some negatives like farming simulator :D to get something  you really need 2 farm alot! thats make the game a bit boring but i would say the story are pretty good atleast for a free 2 play game the graphics are good and you can play with bad computers on this game thanks to the low specs recommend.And for positives this game is very badass u can kill them all with just one shoot :D also this game has many "warframes" so you can chose what suits you :D
I really recommend this game for anyone who love MMO and who love to be a badass ninja and kill everyone :D but if you dont really like to farm alot then dont play this game because this game will make you to farm for hours for that specific item what you need ;-;

